            "review_title": "Review at Kichi Kichi",
            "review_text": "Voyage47652321447\n1 contribution\n0\nKICHI KICHI restaurant: A good option to try!\nJul 2025 • Family\nKichi Kichi is the best restaurant I would like to enjoy. I came for dinner with my family. There was rotary hotpot so new side change continously. The waiter is was so friendly and good care for me.\n We ask for the server used dessert and they answered very carefully. We could choose the favourite flavour in hotpot. You took the side order in the rotary and put in the hotpot. Then you take the food and you dip into sauce. The sauce in there was so great. Ate everything with that sauce are amazing. The food was delicious but it so expesive.\n The staff gave us a warmly welcome and not much helpful for custormer. My dad check out the bill for both of food and drink. Service charge is so fantastic and good. I will be come back when I have time!\n A must for any foodie in the area!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 24, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
